-- [ ] A12.5 New behaviour: each unit can receive only one automatic discount, several different discounts can apply to one order, and the combination with the biggest total saving wins. Examples that must pass: 8 Tadlings = 5x + 3x, 6 Tadlings = one 5x, 5 Tadlings + 2 cows = both deals.
